    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d661">

                <pb facs="0787" n="1621" sameAs="frus:frus1918Supp01v02/pg1621"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 654.119/218</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Minister in
                        Switzerland</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Stovall</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1918-05-10T19:00:00-04:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">May 10, 1918, 7 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>1888. For Dresel [from War Trade Board]:</p>
                <p>No. 18. Legation’s 3244, May 5, 11 a.m. [<hi rendition="#italic">3224, May 2, 3
                        p.m.</hi>], your 21.<anchor n="1" xml:id="d661-f1"/> Lumber agreement and
                    your signature thereto is approved. We will take under consideration three
                    suggestions recited.</p>
                <p>We have had surplus pork products during past two months, which surplus has now
                    disappeared. The Food Administration may therefore not be able to permit the
                    purchase of the total quantity of fats licensed. On account of great demand for
                    steel and other products, you should particularly advise us of any Swiss
                    applications for articles from United States which are for Allied purposes in
                    Switzerland. What are proposed limitation of imports of American, Egyptian, and
                    Indian cotton and what are limitations of exports under the new agreement?</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Lansing</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
